{"unit_id":"lsh2002__dsh-custom-fonts#card-zh","repo":"lsh2002/dsh-custom-fonts","commit":"648efa35ef90ebd1375e545598c4a2da86f22bed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-fonts 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的界面字体插件，在设置页添加字体控制面板，并通过页面样式实时应用设置。它可分别设置英文与中文界面字体、代码区域字体，也可将全局字号按像素偏移；输入框支持字体候选列表和逗号分隔的字体名，页面提供中英文字样及代码预览，并可一键恢复默认。插件通过 settings.section 插槽注册页面，卸载时移除注入的样式。适合希望调整 Web 界面可读性和代码外观的用户；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:125-155","client/client.js:183-235","client/client.js:238-249"]}
{"unit_id":"lsh2002__dsh-custom-fonts#card-en","repo":"lsh2002/dsh-custom-fonts","commit":"648efa35ef90ebd1375e545598c4a2da86f22bed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-custom-fonts adds a DSH Web settings panel for English and Chinese UI fonts, code fonts, and global text-size adjustment. Users can preview mixed-language text and code, enter font lists, and reset settings. Injected styles are removed on unload; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:125-155","client/client.js:183-235","client/client.js:238-249"]}
